Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20full=20UI=20polish=20pass=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20exam=20interface=20+=20admin=20panel?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Exam interface
- ExamHeader: replace emoji with SVG calculator/hamburger icons; white bg
  creates depth against gray canvas; header now has shadow-card
- ExamTimer: SVG clock icon; coloured bg pill per state (neutral/warning/danger);
  clock icon pulses when under 60 s
- FlagButton: replace unicode flag with clean SVG flag that fills on active
- QuestionNavigator: add answered/total progress bar + percentage at top;
  tighter 5-col grid with h-9 buttons; improved legend with current indicator
- DesmosCalculator: draggable via grip-dots header; SVG close icon;
  spinner replaces text loading state; positioned from bottom-right until dragged
- GridInInput: larger 56px centered input; decorative slot underlines;
  format hints table (Integer/Decimal/Negative/Fraction with code examples);
  Student-Produced Response label with divider line
- ConfirmSubmitDialog: coloured status banner (warning/success) with icon
  shows unanswered count; clearer non-reversible copy

Core UI components
- Button: active states; consistent gap; rounded-lg for lg size
- Modal: SVG close icon; footer gets surface-alt bg; rounded-xl panel
- Badge: rounded-full; consistent border opacity values
- Alert: SVG icons per tone (info/success/warning/error); rounded-lg

Admin panel — all files
- Bulk-replaced every remaining bluebook-* class with correct design tokens
  (border-default, bg-surface, text-text-muted, text-accent, bg-surface-alt,
  bg-surface-hover, focus:ring-accent/20 etc.) across 22 files
- AdminSidebar: SVG nav icons (dashboard/tests/questions/students/import);
  avatar chip with initial; sign-out icon button; ADMIN pill badge
- Admin dashboard: completion-rate stat; accent-coloured primary stat;
  rounded-xl cards; hover rows on attempts table; date formatting
- TestListAdmin: rounded-xl list card; hover rows; polished action buttons
  with proper token colours; line-clamp description
- ImageField: SVG upload icon in drop zone; token-correct toggle pill;
  object-contain preview image; polished Remove/Replace buttons
- tailwind.config.ts: add border-focus, accent-hover aliases; add xl/2xl
  border-radius tokens
